{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:0f3743e9412a5126","name":"Taarna Renay","source":{"id":"source:reference-0f3743e9412a5126","title":"Taarna Renay","revision":19791,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:36:34Z","sha256":"646fddf3dce6c6022816415c7b1a4e142cdb8e985ead489619da529c57e6e621","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19791","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Taarna%20Renay&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-0f3743e9412a5126","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Though she is only one of many smugglers in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Point Nadir"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Point_Nadir","referenceId":"reference:480bbe618709d93f"},", Taarna Renay is the most prolific. She frequents the Under the Table cantina, and takes jobs from anyone if she can expect a percentage of the payment up front. She does not ask for details about her cargo, preferring to remain ignorant of potentially life-threatening information. Though independent, Taarna doesn't work alone: She keeps the company of a conscientious ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sullustan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sullustan","referenceId":"reference:ad2946f5a1cb9e4b"}," pilot (and occasional shipjacker) named ",{"tag":"a","children":["Polein Frue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Polein_Frue?action=edit&redlink=1"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Taarna is rarely seen without a blaster worn prominently on her hip, and she is not shy about using it when extreme measures are needed. She is fast and not known for fighting fair.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A young ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," female in her early twenties, Taarna has mid-length curly brown hair, brown eyes, and a few freckles across her cheeks. She smiles easily but dons a grim, dour expression when circumstances are not going her way. She dresses in the fashion of a Corellian ne'er-do-well, with tight-fitting black pants, knee-high boots, a collared shirt, and a black leather vest.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Taarna Renay Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," 8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 6; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +13; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +19\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic, Huttese, Sullustese\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 25 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 21), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 21, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},": 20; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dodge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org